{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "77c31a0ac709c74173b887c2552ebc75b0bf97d643e402a9f828fdbb08634c71", "ja": "（今日は、翼たちのガールズバンド風PV撮影だ。\n準備が大変だったけど、なんとか間に合ったな）", "zh": "（今天翼她们要拍摄女子乐团风格PV。\n前置准备费了很多工夫，但勉强赶上时间了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e335d484a5087fb6dcb3422c0d28ca34c459b9b0a513c9a8644709bc6a90ef3c", "ja": "う～ん、日差しがあったか～い♪\nたまには、外でデートもいいかも！", "zh": "嗯～阳光好温暖～♪\n偶尔在外面约会好像也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3e1e9b79d9036c85e8f4740c913c485eedab8e0bd59fd1b9e51c7f591c725376", "ja": "翼……リラックスしているのはいいけど、\n今日は撮影だって事、忘れてないよな？", "zh": "翼……稍微放松一下是无妨，\n但你应该没有忘记今天要拍摄吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b75aaf7507a72b72f88b91906bd5600bc88fcc2bbfc7d80b1b7b7d3cb2f2f393", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}さん♪\nねえねえ、撮影場所まで一緒に歩きましょうよ～。", "zh": "放心吧，{$P$}先生♪\n欸，我们一起散步到拍摄地点嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a3db080420e6f755d881a45dc97d111c3892b4e0e0af5147c541a07ff0f9f52f", "ja": "それは構わないけど……。", "zh": "可以是可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c94c8e2865a406753c9e427fbe45f5af6aa7e7e64e582b24bbb27c5620ffdd3", "ja": "やった～♪　あ、{$P$}さん！\nあそこ、キレイなちょうちょが飛んでる～！", "zh": "太好了～♪啊，{$P$}先生！\n那里有漂亮的蝴蝶在飞～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d850e5f77356d4c76fc96c4862aedb9387b0292db3b7563215030dd8214ac4c4", "ja": "あのベンチ、お昼寝したら気持ちいいかも。\n今度、美希ちゃんとも来たいな～。", "zh": "躺在那张长椅上睡午觉好像会很舒服。\n真想下次跟美希一起来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1007_p", "source_sha256": "992c1c052ae1dd2dd5ef7b15a6e7566ee333aa83de369d036256818548a4927d", "ja": "翼、滑りやすいから気をつけて。\nそれにしても、今日はずいぶんはしゃいでるな……。", "zh": "翼，那里容易脚滑，小心点。\n话说回来，你今天还真是兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f3e72e45999038b7deda476d7ae02c9e0116c8311a754b78e0798774610adf7", "ja": "えへへ……だってわたし、今日の撮影、\nす～っごく楽しみにしてたんですよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n因为我非～常期待今天的拍摄啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a147a198d6c8da2bb1403be978d390fe7cfea33e59c29f6e7bab81f87dcb3cf8", "ja": "だって{$P$}さん、最後のほう、\nレッスン見に来られなかったじゃないですか～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生最后不是\n没能来看我们练习吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "af26466697f0090042886f4c5a5b2c15cdac1ea08cc941bfb4f012c78aef5d29", "ja": "わたしもみんなも、\nすっごくがんばって楽器練習したのにな～？", "zh": "我跟大家练习乐器练习得那么努力耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b7446c2c4e05928c295c912add180700fea08204d15c0e0e1623d9e159ba8bb2", "ja": "そうだったのか……ごめん。", "zh": "原来是这样……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "97a4dafa2460f347110c2f0ad2f67e6cae1163a416221f1db0c4842aaef3832a", "ja": "忙しかったんだって、わかってますよ～。\n見てもらえなくて、ちょっとさみしかったけど……。", "zh": "我知道你很忙啦～\n只是你没有来看，让我觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "de8f822f639b56f3450d4cc3517d479482cf3f85ca50646e8f817563199499e1", "ja": "でも、素敵なロケ地を見つけてきてくれたから、\nゆるしてあげちゃいま～す！　えへへ♪", "zh": "不过，看在你帮我们找到了很棒的外景地，\n就原谅你啦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
