{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1015_p", "source_sha256": "85e9ed8149a8780609f79f1c054a6eba38e2bc20ee283843fb6ef356146fc069", "ja": "ああ。最高のパフォーマンス、期待してるよ！", "zh": "好，我很期待看见你们最精湛的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0113_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e77cb13ea8ec5fc976a81330252c8750dedeafde9632f02e2e246abaa94a005c", "ja": "はーいっ！　わたしにまかせてください♪\nすっごくカッコイイPVにしちゃうんだから！", "zh": "好的──！请包在我身上吧♪\n我会拍出非常帅气的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
